WEBVTT

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:09.627
Your face is still red.

00:00:09.747 --> 00:00:11.667
You might want to
hit it again with your hammer.

00:00:11.747 --> 00:00:14.387
Oh, that's not blunt force trauma, ma'am.

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:17.267
That's just the honey glow
in my cheeks.

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:19.107
Okay.

00:00:19.507 --> 00:00:22.507
Ma'am, I just got to tell you...

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:25.227
You are one dynamite gal.

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:31.307
Wow, you are one dynamite gal.

00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:33.867
One dynamite gal.

00:00:34.227 --> 00:00:35.627
Dynamite gal.

00:00:35.787 --> 00:00:37.147
Dynamite gal.

00:00:37.307 --> 00:00:38.547
Dynamite...

00:00:39.827 --> 00:00:40.867
(SCREAMING)

00:00:44.147 --> 00:00:45.307
Get out.

00:00:45.387 --> 00:00:47.307
All I said is you're a dynamite gal.

00:00:47.427 --> 00:00:48.907
I said get out!

00:00:57.147 --> 00:00:59.507
Oh. Jiminey jaminey.

00:01:05.587 --> 00:01:07.347
Yes?

00:01:07.747 --> 00:01:08.787
Oh.

00:01:09.067 --> 00:01:13.347
I'm Fix-It Felix Jr., sir,
from the game Fix-It Felix Jr.

00:01:13.707 --> 00:01:15.027
Have you seen my friend Ralph?

00:01:15.587 --> 00:01:16.627
Wreck-It Ralph?

00:01:16.867 --> 00:01:18.387
Yes. Yes, that's him!

00:01:18.707 --> 00:01:21.547
We should have locked him up
when we had the chance.

00:01:21.747 --> 00:01:22.867
Locked him up?

00:01:23.227 --> 00:01:25.907
I'm not making
the same mistake with you.

00:01:26.867 --> 00:01:28.387
(SCREAMS)

00:01:29.987 --> 00:01:32.267
VANELLOPE: Hurry, hurry!
Let's go. Time's a-wastin'.

00:01:32.387 --> 00:01:33.507
Come on, Ralph!

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:35.547
This is it. This is really happening.

00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:36.947
I almost don't believe it.

00:01:37.027 --> 00:01:39.947
I mean, I have dreamt about it
for so long, and now...

00:01:40.187 --> 00:01:42.187
And now... Now I think
I'm going to puke, actually.

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:43.707
I mean, I think I might puke.

00:01:43.787 --> 00:01:45.347
-You know, like a "vurp."
-A what?

00:01:45.507 --> 00:01:47.187
Vomit and a burp together,

00:01:47.267 --> 00:01:49.587
and you can taste it,
and it's just like rising up.

00:01:49.707 --> 00:01:51.027
Oh, this is so exciting!

00:01:51.347 --> 00:01:52.907
Yes, it is. It's exciting.

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:55.067
Am I ready to be a real racer?

00:01:55.307 --> 00:01:57.347
Ralph, what if the gamers don't like me?

00:01:57.467 --> 00:02:00.827
Who doesn't love a brat
with dirty hair? Come on.

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:04.267
Those people are going
to love you. You know why?

00:02:04.947 --> 00:02:07.067
-Because you're a winner.
-I'm a winner.

00:02:07.187 --> 00:02:09.947
-And you're adorable!
-I'm adorable!

00:02:10.107 --> 00:02:11.667
And everyone loves
an adorable winner!

00:02:11.947 --> 00:02:13.227
Yeah!

00:02:13.307 --> 00:02:15.467
Okay, come on. Listen to me.

00:02:15.587 --> 00:02:18.627
If you get nervous,
just keep telling yourself,

00:02:18.747 --> 00:02:22.907
"I must win Ralph's medal
or his life will be ruined."

00:02:23.307 --> 00:02:25.307
-And have fun. Got it?
-Got it.

00:02:25.867 --> 00:02:26.867
Whoa!

00:02:27.067 --> 00:02:28.187
Oh, wait!

00:02:28.547 --> 00:02:29.587
(BRAKES SCREECHING)

00:02:29.667 --> 00:02:30.827
Hold on!

00:02:30.907 --> 00:02:31.907
Where are you going?

00:02:31.987 --> 00:02:33.907
I forgot something! I'll be right back!

00:02:35.307 --> 00:02:36.347
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:36.467 --> 00:02:37.467
Kids.

00:02:38.627 --> 00:02:39.667
(HONKING)

00:02:39.747 --> 00:02:42.147
Ralph! (CHUCKLES)
There you are. Hello!

00:02:42.707 --> 00:02:45.467
-You!
-I come alone, unarmed.

00:02:45.867 --> 00:02:48.067
I've had enough of you, pillow pants!

00:02:48.147 --> 00:02:50.067
Please. Calm down! Please, look. Don't!

00:02:50.147 --> 00:02:51.147
(SHUDDERING)

00:02:51.267 --> 00:02:52.947
I'm going to beat the filling out of you!

00:02:53.547 --> 00:02:56.067
You wouldn't hit a guy
with glasses, would you?

00:02:56.307 --> 00:02:59.507
You hit a guy with glasses.
That's... Well played.

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:01.947
-(GASPS)
-What do you want, Candy?

00:03:02.027 --> 00:03:03.507
Listen, I just want to talk to you.

00:03:03.787 --> 00:03:06.627
I'm not interested in
anything you have to say.

00:03:06.907 --> 00:03:10.667
How about this?
Are you interested in this?

00:03:10.827 --> 00:03:12.747
My medal. How did you...

00:03:12.867 --> 00:03:16.547
It doesn't matter.
It's yours! Go ahead, take it.

00:03:16.627 --> 00:03:17.667
(CHUCKLES)

00:03:18.267 --> 00:03:19.347
Whoa.

00:03:20.587 --> 00:03:22.507
All I ask is that you hear me out.

00:03:22.867 --> 00:03:23.987
About what?

00:03:24.267 --> 00:03:27.107
Ralph, do you know
what the hardest part

00:03:27.187 --> 00:03:28.747
about being a king is?

00:03:29.107 --> 00:03:31.507
Doing what's right, no matter what.

00:03:31.747 --> 00:03:32.787
Get to the point.

00:03:32.907 --> 00:03:35.067
Point being, I need your help.

00:03:35.387 --> 00:03:39.827
Sad as it is, Vanellope
cannot be allowed to race.

00:03:40.027 --> 00:03:41.987
Why are you people so against her?

00:03:42.227 --> 00:03:45.227
I'm not against her!
I'm trying to protect her!

00:03:45.307 --> 00:03:47.107
If Vanellope wins that race

00:03:48.067 --> 00:03:50.227
she'll be added to the race roster.

00:03:50.667 --> 00:03:53.827
Then gamers can choose her
as their avatar.

00:03:54.907 --> 00:03:56.707
And when they see her glitching

00:03:56.787 --> 00:03:59.507
and twitching and just being herself,

00:03:59.627 --> 00:04:01.387
they'll think our game is broken.

00:04:03.587 --> 00:04:04.627
We'll be put out of order for good.

00:04:05.987 --> 00:04:08.427
All my subjects will be homeless.

00:04:08.507 --> 00:04:10.347
(SHOUTING)

00:04:10.427 --> 00:04:14.467
But there's one who cannot
escape because she's a glitch.

00:04:14.547 --> 00:04:17.187
Help! Somebody, help! Help!

00:04:17.267 --> 00:04:19.747
KING CANDY: And when
the game's plug is pulled...

00:04:19.827 --> 00:04:21.147
(SCREAMS) No!

00:04:22.747 --> 00:04:24.547
...she'll die with it.

00:04:25.787 --> 00:04:27.747
You don't know that will happen.

00:04:27.827 --> 00:04:29.067
The gamers could love her.

00:04:29.587 --> 00:04:31.227
And if they don't?

00:04:38.547 --> 00:04:40.587
I know it's tough,

00:04:40.667 --> 00:04:43.867
but heroes have to make
the tough choices, don't they?

00:04:44.627 --> 00:04:49.627
She can't race, Ralph,
but she won't listen to me.

00:04:50.187 --> 00:04:53.147
So can I count on you to
talk a little sense into her?

00:04:56.067 --> 00:04:57.107
Very good.

00:04:57.587 --> 00:05:00.707
I'll give you two some time alone.

00:05:25.987 --> 00:05:27.027
(SIGHS)

00:05:27.107 --> 00:05:28.187
I'm back!

00:05:29.467 --> 00:05:30.587
Did you miss me?

00:05:30.787 --> 00:05:34.747
Yeah... Uh... Can we talk for a second?

00:05:34.947 --> 00:05:36.947
Wait. First, kneel down.

00:05:37.147 --> 00:05:39.307
-What? No, we really...
-Will you just do it?

00:05:40.107 --> 00:05:41.187
Okay.

00:05:42.467 --> 00:05:45.387
-Now, close your eyes.
-Vanellope...

00:05:45.467 --> 00:05:46.827
Shush! Close them!

00:05:47.147 --> 00:05:48.387
(EXHALES)

00:05:50.587 --> 00:05:51.987
Okay. Open them up.

00:05:55.027 --> 00:05:57.787
"To Stinkbrain." Gee, thanks.

00:05:57.867 --> 00:05:58.947
Turn it over.

00:06:01.387 --> 00:06:02.827
I made it for you.

00:06:03.507 --> 00:06:04.987
Just in case we don't win.

00:06:05.267 --> 00:06:07.427
Not that I think
there's even a remote chance

00:06:07.507 --> 00:06:08.547
we're not going to win.

00:06:08.947 --> 00:06:11.347
Thanks, kid. Listen...

00:06:11.627 --> 00:06:16.347
Now rise, my royal chump.
I've got a date with destiny.

00:06:17.187 --> 00:06:19.427
Ralph, come on. Move your molasses.

00:06:19.507 --> 00:06:20.667
Um...

00:06:21.307 --> 00:06:23.467
-I've been thinking.
-That's dangerous.

00:06:23.947 --> 00:06:26.707
Who cares about
this stupid race anyway? Right?

00:06:27.307 --> 00:06:29.227
(LAUGHS) That's not very funny, Ralph.

00:06:29.387 --> 00:06:31.427
No, I'm serious, and it was really fun

00:06:31.507 --> 00:06:32.667
to build the car and everything...

00:06:32.747 --> 00:06:35.827
But maybe you shouldn't do it.

00:06:36.027 --> 00:06:38.467
Hello? Is Ralph in there?

00:06:38.547 --> 00:06:40.067
I'd like to speak to him, please.

00:06:40.227 --> 00:06:42.107
Look, what I'm saying is
you can't be a racer.

00:06:42.427 --> 00:06:43.427
What?

00:06:44.947 --> 00:06:46.147
Why would you...

00:06:47.227 --> 00:06:49.027
Wait a minute.

00:06:49.587 --> 00:06:50.627
No!

00:06:50.707 --> 00:06:51.747
Where did you get this?

00:06:52.827 --> 00:06:54.867
Look, I'm going to be
straight with you, kid.

00:06:54.947 --> 00:06:56.467
I've been talking to King Candy.

00:06:56.547 --> 00:06:58.107
-King Candy?
-Yeah.

00:06:58.187 --> 00:06:59.427
You sold me out?

00:06:59.587 --> 00:07:01.347
No, I didn't... Listen.
You don't understand.

00:07:01.547 --> 00:07:03.747
No, I understand plenty. Traitor!

00:07:04.067 --> 00:07:05.067
I'm not a traitor. Listen.

00:07:05.227 --> 00:07:06.507
You're a rat!

00:07:06.707 --> 00:07:10.067
And I don't need you, and
I can win the race on my own.

00:07:10.147 --> 00:07:11.907
But I'm trying to save your skin, kid!

00:07:12.027 --> 00:07:13.747
Put me down! Let me go!

00:07:13.867 --> 00:07:14.987
No, you listen to me.

00:07:15.067 --> 00:07:16.067
Do you know what's going to happen

00:07:16.147 --> 00:07:17.147
when the players see you glitching?

00:07:17.227 --> 00:07:18.507
They'll think the game's broken.

00:07:18.587 --> 00:07:19.987
I don't care! You're a liar!

00:07:20.107 --> 00:07:22.587
You better care, because
if your game goes out of order,

00:07:22.667 --> 00:07:23.667
you go down with the ship, little sister!

00:07:23.747 --> 00:07:24.787
I'm not listening to you!

00:07:24.867 --> 00:07:27.627
Get out of my way!
I'm going to that race!

00:07:27.907 --> 00:07:29.067
No, you're not!

00:07:29.347 --> 00:07:30.827
(GRUNTING)

00:07:30.907 --> 00:07:33.707
Take me down from here, Ralph,
right now!

00:07:34.187 --> 00:07:36.067
No. I'm doing this for your own good!

00:07:38.547 --> 00:07:39.547
Wait, wait, wait.

00:07:40.307 --> 00:07:41.427
No. No.

00:07:42.227 --> 00:07:43.427
No, no, no, no, no!

00:07:43.507 --> 00:07:44.667
Please, Ralph!

00:07:44.787 --> 00:07:45.747
-(SMASHING)
-No!

00:07:46.867 --> 00:07:50.067
Stop it! Stop it! No!

00:07:52.307 --> 00:07:53.307
(VANELLOPE SOBBING)

00:07:58.627 --> 00:08:00.707
(RALPH PANTING)

00:08:06.507 --> 00:08:08.627
You really are a bad guy.

